  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Humane and Orderly Logistics in Mexico During Resumption of the Migrant Protection Protocols</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM aims to contribute to an orderly and safe resumption of the Migrant Protection Protocols (MPP), a United States Government policy whereby migrants seeking admission to the United States return to Mexico to wait for the duration of their immigration proceedings, though facilitating safe and orderly transportation for the protection of enrollees. IOM will make available its extensive logistical expertise in northern border cities for other operations involving MPP participants through installed field capacities and offices with trained staff.</narrative>
  </description>
